{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 201 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E18", "E15", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Mannitol has been on FDA's shortage list since 2021-09-23, a span of 61 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant for Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1025114) was classified OAI on 2024-02-09, which was 201 days before the shortage posting date of 2021-09-23.",
      "cites": ["E18", "E15", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another registered plant for Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1416980) was classified OAI on 2026-04-02, after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E28", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 1416980) on 2026-09-29.",
      "cites": ["E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "B. Braun Medical Inc. is also a labeler for mannitol, but its plant inspection history is not provided in the evidence.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant was last inspected VAI on 2023-10-13.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory at Corvale East and Corvale General provides between 8.2 and 15.7 days on hand across presentations.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "D4"]
    }
  ]
}
